# Admission repair design; mandatory review and replanning precede unbuilt qualification.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Byte-complete evidence contract\nExact scope / raw sequences / copy-file coordinates\nOriginal bytes separate from decoder witnesses" {class: start}
Plan: "Next · Actual k270 human authority / permission choices\nThen k273 replacement design + whole review / integration\nK269 replans only afterwards; k244 obligations retained"
Replay: "Early · Independent inventory / closed proof / admission\nSchema-valid omission must fail\nIndependent reviewed admission anchors; self-digests insufficient"
Decode: "Native byte / format / runtime witnesses\nFormat-derived ≠ CF-corroborated ≠ regression-only\nSeparate observer, complete branches / joint tails"
Source: "Lossless source + held-directory evidence\nComplete independent syscall / IPC / proxy coverage required\nAll occurrences / fixed files / locales / item closure"
Pure: "Exact retained fixed-composition rehearsal\nExact entry / live-channel refusal and runtime read closure\nThen implementation review / repairs / final qualification"
Authority: "Before target · Qualified authority provisioning / validation\nConsumption survives attempt deletion; separate evidence lifecycle\nVerified derivative export; changed inputs require requalification"
Pass: "Then · One authorized current-reference pass\nCheck macOS 27.0.1 / 26A434 first\nOnly fixed query / checked roots / fixed files / direct locales"
Closure: "Freeze every item before and after\nRaw slots / inventories / payloads / tools / identities\nComplete bytes and qualified typed evidence are separate"
Failed: "Failed or interrupted target attempt\nPreserve partial bytes / exact missing work\nPass consumed · no silent retry or substituted bytes"
Roles: "Later · Independent copy roles and whole recipes\nApple / vendor evidence + human-confirmed purpose\nAll useful / helper / alias branches and tails"
Review: "Later · Complete subject / whole-family review\nDeclared rewrites must pass; shape loss must fail\nActual supported-VM baseline is additive"
Hold: "Private eligibility remains false\nBoth holds · native G/N/V pending\nExisting N5 / N8 / V11 / V13 only after every prerequisite"
Start -> Plan: "1 · design qualifies no tool"
Plan -> Replay: "2 · reviewed plan supplies actual owners"
Replay -> Decode: "3 · usable earlier checks remain green"
Decode -> Source: "4 · pure inputs only"
Source -> Pure: "5 · independent contact coverage required"
Pure -> Authority: "6 · unchanged complete candidate / proofs"
Authority -> Pass: "7 · no unavailable prerequisite may admit"
Pass -> Closure: "8 · preserve every association"
Closure -> Failed: "9a · unknown / missing / changed"
Closure -> Roles: "9b · complete evidence only"
Roles -> Review: "10 · no cardinality-only subject"
Review -> Hold: "11 · this contract releases nothing"
